{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_succ\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod_succ</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">e </span><span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod\">powMod</a></span> (<span class=\"fn\">e</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod\">powMod</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">e</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Not `@[simp]`: it would expand a numeric exponent into repeated multiplication. ","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_succ","kind":"theorem","line":61,"name":"Nat.powMod_succ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.lean#L61-L63"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_zero\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod_zero</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod\">powMod</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_zero","kind":"theorem","line":59,"name":"Nat.powMod_zero","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.lean#L59-L59"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_def\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod_def</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">e </span><span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod\">powMod</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">e</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">e</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod_def","kind":"theorem","line":46,"name":"Nat.powMod_def","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.lean#L46-L57"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">powMod</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b </span><span class=\"fn\">e </span><span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes `b ^ e % m` by square-and-multiply, reducing modulo `m` at each step so\nthat no intermediate value exceeds the square of the larger of `b` and `m`.\n\nBecause `Nat.mod` satisfies `n % 0 = n`, `powMod b e 0` is `b ^ e`. That case is\nthe exception to the bound above: there the intermediates are as large as the\nresult.\n\n`powMod` is not definitionally equal to `b ^ e % m`. Concrete exponents reduce in\n`O(log e)` steps under `decide`, which `b ^ e % m` could not, and `simp` evaluates\nclosed terms with the `Nat.reducePowMod` simproc. For symbolic reasoning, rewrite\nwith `powMod_def`, which is deliberately not `@[simp]`: it would turn a cheap\n`powMod` goal into an intractable `b ^ e % m` one.\n\nExamples:\n* `powMod 3 4 5 = 1`\n* `powMod 2 10 1000 = 24`\n* `powMod 3 4 0 = 81`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.html#Nat.powMod","kind":"def","line":18,"name":"Nat.powMod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Nat/PowMod.lean#L18-L44"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Nat.Lemmas","Init.Omega","Init.RCases","Init.WFTactics"],"instances":[],"name":"Init.Data.Nat.PowMod"}